🚀 Portfolio Project Summary: Superstore Retail Analytics Dashboard

Project Overview:
Designed and developed an interactive, end-to-end business intelligence dashboard in Power BI using a transactional dataset of over 9,994 global retail orders.
The project was executed under a mock client framework to diagnose why aggressive promotional discounting strategies were failing to translate into clean net profit
margins for corporate stakeholders.


Sheet1
Executive Overview

The Executive Overview dashboard provides a high-level summary of business performance and key operational metrics. It enables stakeholders to quickly assess overall
company performance through key indicators such as Total Sales, Total Profit, Total Orders, Average Delivery Days, Profit Margin, and Average Discount offered across
products.

Interactive filters allow users to analyze performance by Year, Region, and Sub-Category, making it easier to focus on specific business segments.

Key visualizations include:

Profit Trend Analysis: A line chart showing profit performance over time, helping identify growth patterns and seasonal fluctuations.
Category Performance Analysis: A bar chart comparing profit contribution across major product categories, highlighting the most profitable areas of the business.
Dynamic Filtering: Users can drill into specific years, regions, and product sub-categories to gain deeper insights into sales and profitability.

This dashboard serves as a central monitoring page, providing management with a quick snapshot of business health and enabling data-driven decision-making.
